<title>USA: Liposome stake raised by Kenneth Dart.</title>
<headline>Liposome stake raised by Kenneth Dart.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Kenneth Dart, president of Dart Container Corp, said on Friday it raised its stake in Liposome Co Inc's oustanding Series A common shares to 12.02 percent or 4,349,346 shares from 10.98 percent or 3,974,346 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought shares of the Princeton, N.J. drug company between April 15 and April 17 at $21 to $22 a share.</p>
